  "summary": "C5 loads the 60x60 region slices for 1991-12-27..2003-01-05 and the 2016 summer into /tmp/d.npz. C6 reads that file back, builds per-cell hazen 90th-percentile thresholds from \u00b15-day pools, and smooths them with a 31-day wrap-around mean. Only the smoothed thresholds for day-of-year 138..259 (pools May 12\u2013Sep 20 of each baseline year) are compared with every 2016-06-01..08-31 SST of the sea cells to form the hot/run mask that is written to output/mhw_mask.nc; the climatology is unused."
